    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Chemist 8</p><p>When the chemist creates a bomb, he can choose to have it deal good, holy damage. Evil creatures that take a direct hit from a holy bomb must succeed at a Fortitude save or be illuminated on their next turn. Against neutral creatures, holy bombs deal half damage, and such targets are not affected by their staggering effect. Holy bombs have no effect on good-aligned creatures.</p><p><em>* This discovery modifies bombs. Discoveries marked with an asterisk do not stack; only one such discovery can be applied to an individual bomb.</em></p>",
